><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>#<space>Create<space>an<space>attribute<space>with<space>suffix<space><quote>.hyperlink<quote><space>from<space>the<space>attribute<space>at<space>the<space>first<space>index<space>position<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>index<space>=<space>0<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>attr_names.insert<openparen>index<space>+<space>1<comma><space>f<apos><opencurly>attr_names<openbracket>index<closebracket><closecurly>.hyperlink<apos><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>attr_types.insert<openparen>index<space>+<space>1<comma><space>attr_types<openbracket>index<closebracket><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>feature.setAttribute<openparen><apos>attribute<opencurly><closecurly>.name<apos><comma><space>attr_names<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>feature.setAttribute<openparen><apos>attribute<opencurly><closecurly>.fme_data_type<apos><comma><space>attr_types<closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>self.pyoutput<openparen>feature<comma><space>output_tag=<quote>PYOUTPUT<quote><closeparen><lf><lf><space><space><space><space>def<space>close<openparen>self<closeparen>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><quote><quote><quote>This<space>method<space>is<space>called<space>once<space>all<space>the<space>FME<space>Features<space>have<space>been<space>processed<space>from<space>input<openparen><closeparen>.<quote><quote><quote><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>pass<lf><lf><space><space><space><space>def<space>process_group<openparen>self<closeparen>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><quote><quote><quote>This<space>method<space>is<space>called<space>by<space>FME<space>for<space>each<space>group<space>when<space>group<s